# The built-in OPC UA profiles (generic + sinumerik_840d) ship here so they survive the
# docker-compose bind mount of ./profiles over /app/profiles (a bind mount hides whatever
# the image baked in). Drop additional site-specific profile bundles alongside them — one
# <name>.yaml + optional <name>.template.xml per equipment class. Generated by the
# opcua-profile-gui tool in tools/opcua-profile-gui/. See ../README.md.
